  "default/30935.htm": {
   "file": "default/30935.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Collector Trumpin: Greetings! I am Trumpin. I am visiting the Ivory Tower in order to do some business with my younger sister. Unfortunately my back is killing me! I can't do business like this... Ouch!",
   "header": "Collector Trumpin",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Tell me about the Ivory Tower.\"",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 1",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/30935-1.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Tell me about your younger sister.\"",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 2",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/30935-2.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Quest",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Quest",
     "kind": "quest-menu",
     "to": "@questlist"
    }
   ]
  },
  "default/30935-1.htm": {
   "file": "default/30935-1.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Collector Trumpin: Working under the shadow of the Ivory Tower, I often admire its graceful beauty. It reminds me of a delicate porcelain vase, that but with the slightest bit of mishandling would shatter into millions of pieces. It doesn't seem structurally sound, does it? Any Dwarf with a basic k…",
   "header": "Collector Trumpin",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Return",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 0",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/30935.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "default/30935-2.htm": {
   "file": "default/30935-2.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Collector Trumpin: My sister's name is Marsha. She is a collector like myself, very outgoing and bright. Her only flaw is her habit of solving problems by trickery instead of real work, but you will find her plain-spoken and easy-to-read. Not long ago she and I were running away from monster eyes a…",
   "header": "Collector Trumpin",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Return",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 0",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/30935.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-01.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Collector Trumpin: Ah, it seems we have common interests... You also seek Nebulite Orbs for Magic Trader Cema? I can't continue right now, I must return to the village and rest my back... Would you care to play a game of chance to try and win the Nebulite Orbs I've collected so far? It's a simple c…",
   "header": "Collector Trumpin",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Tell me the rules of the game.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30935-01b.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30935-01b.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-01b.html"
    },
    {
     "text": "Play the game.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30935-03.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30935-03.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-03.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-03.html",
      "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-04.html"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Quit",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30935-01a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30935-01a.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-01a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-01a.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-01a.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Collector Trumpin: Oh well, it's your loss. What am I going to do with all these Nebulite Orbs? If you change your mind, come back to see me. I'll be here resting my back.",
   "header": "Collector Trumpin",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-01b.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-01b.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Collector Trumpin: The rules are simple: I will toss a coin in the air and you guess and call out which side you think it will land on, heads or tails. Let's try it. If you win the first round, you can either receive 10 Nebulite Orbs or play a second round. If you win in the second round, you can e…",
   "header": "Collector Trumpin",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Return",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30935-01.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30935-01.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-01.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-03.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30935-03.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Collector Trumpin: You must have at least 10 Nebulite Orbs to play the coin-toss game, on the off chance that you could lose. Go and find some more Nebulite and come back to see me! I'll be waiting~!",
   "header": "Collector Trumpin",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
